  {
   "id": "t_8cf1472f0ffb9f6c5fdc",
   "sourceHash": "8cf1472f0ffb9f6c5fdce24a28deb726022bacb3689d2ce1606388f87ff851cd",
   "text": "ما حقّقه كاركيداكا (Karkidaka) لمرضانا",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'Guests' rendered as 'مرضانا' (our patients) per the KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_15bf3daed3cf826c6cf5",
   "sourceHash": "15bf3daed3cf826c6cf54821f7d5a0fca9843ac06298834b338634e16b672c96",
   "text": "نتائج موثّقة شاركها مرضى أتمّوا برامج كاركيداكا في Kairali.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
